OL,3,GNEWSAHalf of 18 Kent beaches closed due
OL,4,Ato oil spill reopen                    
OL,6,FNine of the 18 Kent beaches that were  
OL,7,Fclosed due to an oil spill have        
OL,8,Freopened.                              
OL,10,FThanet District Council closed its     
OL,11,Fbeaches on 11 November "to protect the 
OL,12,Fpublic" after the oil was found.       
OL,14,FBeaches along the northern coastline - 
OL,15,Ffrom Minnis Bay to Palm Bay, including 
OL,16,FMargate Main Sands - reopened on Friday
OL,17,Fafter oil deposits were cleaned up, the
OL,18,Fcouncil said. Sites from Botany Bay in 
OL,19,FBroadstairs to Ramsgate Main Sands     
OL,20,Fremain closed.                         
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
