OL,3,GNEWSAHalf of 18 Kent beaches closed due
OL,4,Ato oil spill reopen                    
OL,6,F"Beach users should be aware that some 
OL,7,Fsmall oil deposits may remain, or be   
OL,8,Fcovered by sand and may not be         
OL,9,Fimmediately visible," the authority    
OL,10,Fwarned.                                
